{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eb800866-cf5b-89aa-8adb-4fc5f7cea177",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T10:44:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. This is Raj Goldberg. I'm calling about my recycling. The BIN, specifically. I need a replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. What happened to the old one? Cracked, stolen, gone missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cracked. The truck, I think. The lid came off and the BOTTOM split right down the side. It's useless now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, cracked bin. Let me grab that down. And what's the address where it goes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:40:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "28 Carroll Avenue. That's in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-eight Carroll Avenue. Got it. And is this the recycling bin, the blue one, or the trash cart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The recycling. The BLUE one. Trash cart is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:40:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Let me put in the request. Do you have a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:41:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three. Perfect. Sorry, is that a landline? I hear a bit of an echo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:41:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is a landline, yes. I'm at work, in the BREAK room. Somebody made popcorn. The whole room smells of it. Forgive the noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:41:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear a microwave somewhere. Okay, so replacement bin for twenty-eight Carroll. They usually drop it at the curb, so you don't need to be home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:41:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. How long does it take, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:41:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually within a week or two. Could be a little longer this time of year with the holidays just behind us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:42:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Now, one more question. What can go in the recycling NOW? I've heard the rules changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:42:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What are you wondering about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:42:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pizza boxes. Glass. And those plastic CLAMSHELLS, from the grocery. The berries, the salad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me go through those. Pizza boxes, if they're clean, the top and any part without grease can go in. The greasy bottom is trash, or you tear off the clean part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tear off the clean part. All right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Glass bottles and jars are fine. Rinse them out, lids off if you can. Clamshells, the number one through number seven hard plastic ones, are generally accepted, but just make sure they're empty and rinsed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:43:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So glass, yes. Clamshells, yes, if RINSED. Pizza box, only the clean part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If you want the full list, there's a flyer on the city website, and I can mail you one too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail would be good. I don't use the computer much. Same address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:43:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-eight Carroll Avenue, I'll note it with the bin request. Anything else, Mr. Goldberg?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:43:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. Thank you. I will get back to my LUNCH."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:44:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:44:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You as well. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
